[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よくやった、１次審査突破だ！\r\nさすがだな、夏葉！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "013",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "何をはしゃいでいるの、まだ１次審査よ\r\nこれぐらい通って当然でしょう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\nでも、やっぱりすごいものはすごいよ、おめでとう",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "これからまだまだ先へ進まなくてはいけないというのに、\r\nのん気なものね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "次の審査通過に向けて改善すべき点はたくさんあるわ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私には立ち止まる時間なんていらないの！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さすがだな\r\nそのやる気は夏葉の魅力の１つだよ",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "まったく……そんなことを言っている暇があるのなら、\r\nレッスンに付き合いなさい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "行くわよ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん、どうした？",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……でも\r\nやっぱり努力が認められるっていうのは、うれしいことね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（本当は１次審査通過したのが嬉しかったんだな……）",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉は人１倍努力していたからな、\r\nそれが多くの人にも伝わった……当然の結果だよ",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……いいえ！　まだまだ、これからよ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "世界一になるためには、トレーニングもレッスンも\r\nもっともっと頑張らないといけないわ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった、夏葉がトップアイドルになれるように\r\n俺も全力でサポートするよ",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そうよ、プロデューサーにも\r\nもっとこれまで以上に頑張ってもらわないと！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "でも、１番大切なのは私自身の努力だわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉はこれまでどおり頑張れば大丈夫だ",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいえ、高みを目指す為には、これまで以上に\r\nもっと自分を磨かないといけないのよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "プロデューサー、これからもっと私、頑張るから！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300101/7013001010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001010140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "絶対、世界一のアイドルになってみせるわ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
